      <activity id="3bfd473b-7480-5e16-8100-60497b1471c2" activityNameId="260f38b2-ed38-5eaf-9815-1866dd261cac" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door frame, outer, wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door frame, outer, wood, at plant
Data are based on a door leaf of 1m x 2m and scaled to 1m2 door. 1m2 of wooden door frame weighs 8.8kg. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.;
UUID: 7509327b-fdf6-3a43-b24b-eb7922ad109b
Included are the materials used in an outer wooden door frame (without surface treatment). Production losses and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7509327b-fdf6-3a43-b24b-eb7922ad109b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
